      "rule": "Eave overhang minimal, not exceeding 12 in, with a closed or plastered edge and no exposed rafter tails -- the opposite of mission-revival's wide overhang on exposed tails (24-42 in), which diagnostic_tells names as the test that separates the two.",
      "confidence": "high",
      "note": "Overrides the inherited mediterranean-vernacular bracket eave (600-1200 mm on paired modiglioni), a genuinely different, much larger overhang drawn from the Italian villa vernacular rather than this style's own Spanish/Latin sources.",
